        <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mb-12">
          <div class="bg-warm rounded-2xl p-6 border border-warm-tertiary text-center">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-ink text-sm mb-2">1. Get in touch</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-ink-muted leading-relaxed">Message us on WhatsApp or email to get started.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-warm rounded-2xl p-6 border border-warm-tertiary text-center">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-ink text-sm mb-2">2. Book your session</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-ink-muted leading-relaxed">We work out together which psychologist to start with and find a time that suits you. A secure video link is sent to you beforehand.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-warm rounded-2xl p-6 border border-warm-tertiary text-center">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-ink text-sm mb-2">3. Connect and begin</h3>
