        <div class="bg-primary/5 rounded-2xl p-8 border border-primary/15">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-ink mb-4">Is online therapy as effective as in-person?</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-ink-muted leading-relaxed">Research shows that for most concerns, online sessions give results comparable to in-person ones. What matters most is the therapeutic relationship, and that can be built over video too.</p>
        </div>
