    <section class="py-16 bg-warm">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-5 lg:px-8">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl text-ink mb-6">Is online therapy as effective as meeting in person?</h2>
        <p class="text-ink-muted leading-relaxed mb-4">For depression, anxiety disorders and stress-related presentations, online therapy produces results comparable to in-person sessions. What determines whether therapy works is not the channel but the working relationship, and that relationship can be built over a screen.</p>
        <p class="text-ink-muted leading-relaxed">We look at the research in more detail here: <a href="/en/blog/is-online-therapy-effective.html" class="text-primary underline hover:no-underline">Is Online Therapy Effective?</a></p>
      </div>
    </section>

