        <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl text-ink mb-6">Who is online therapy suitable for, and who is it not?</h2>
        <p class="text-ink-muted leading-relaxed mb-8">Online sessions suit anyone who finds it hard to come to the centre regularly. In some situations meeting in person is the better choice. The table sets out the difference; if you are unsure, we decide together in the first meeting.</p>
        <div class="overflow-x-auto">
          <table class="w-full text-sm border border-warm-tertiary rounded-2xl overflow-hidden">
