    <section class="py-16 bg-warm">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-5 lg:px-8">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl text-ink mb-6">Is an online session private, and what do I need?</h2>
        <p class="text-ink-muted leading-relaxed mb-4">Sessions run over a secure video connection and are not recorded. Sessions and your personal information are protected in line with confidentiality principles; the same applies online.</p>
        <p class="text-ink-muted leading-relaxed mb-4">Technically, a phone, tablet or computer with an internet connection is enough. You do not need to install anything; the link is sent to you.</p>
        <p class="text-ink-muted leading-relaxed">Being somewhere private, with a door that closes, matters. If that is not possible we look for a solution together — sometimes arranging a room at the centre is one.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
